{title: Another Advocate}
{subtitle: John 14:16–17}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 70}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [F/A] | [Eb/G] [Eb/F] | [Bb] [F/A] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]I will ask the [F/A]Father [Gm7]now
He [Cm7]will give you [Bb]another [Fsus4]guide
[F]To be [Bb]with you fo[F/A]rever[Gm7]more
In the [Eb]quiet of the [Bb]night
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Eb]The Spirit of truth [Bb]comes [F]near
[Gm7]Who the [Eb]world cannot re[Bb]ceive
It [Eb]neither sees nor [F]knows his [Gm7]face
But [Eb]you have him with[Bb]in [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Another [Bb]Advocate with [F]you
The [Gm7]Spirit of truth re[Eb]mains
He is in you [Bb]and [F]with [Gm7][Eb]you
The truth that [F]no one [Bb]claims [F/A][Eb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]He will not [F/A]leave you as [Gm7]orphans
I am [Eb]coming [Bb]to re[F]turn
[Bb]In a little [F/A]while you [Gm7]see
The [Eb]Father in the [Bb]Son
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
[Eb]The world will see me [Bb]no [F]more
[Gm7]But [Eb]you will see me [Bb]live
Be[Eb]cause I live [F]you will [Gm7]live
In the [Eb]Father and in [Bb]me [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Another [Bb]Advocate with [F]you
The [Gm]Spirit of truth re[Eb]mains
He is in you [Bb]and [F]with [Gm][Eb]you
The truth that [F]no one [Bb]claims
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
You [Eb]know him for he [F]stays
He re[Gm]mains with you al[Bb/D]ways
The [Eb]world does not [F]know his [Gm]name
But [Eb]you are not a[Bb]lone
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
You [Eb]know him for he [F]stays
The [Gm]Spirit of truth
[Eb]He remains [Bb]with [F][Bb][F/A][Eb/G]you [Eb][Bb]
{end_of_verse}
